- Handle unavailable APIs and database failures.
- Handle invalid Gemini responses.
- Validate AI-generated plans before execution.
- Add bounded retries for eligible transient errors.
- Record execution failures.
- Make database operations idempotent where appropriate.
- Provide actionable error messages.
- Never mark a failed operation as successful.

